  "content": "# 第33题\n\n**题型**: 选择题\n\n**难度**: ★★★☆☆\n\n**分值**: 2分\n\n---\n\n## 题目内容\n\n33. What does the underlined word “prone” in Paragraph 3 most probably mean?\n\n## 选项\n\nA. A. Open.\n\nB. B. Cool.\n\nC. C. Useful.\n\nD. D. Resistant.\n\n---\n\n## 参考答案\n\nA\n\n",
  "answer": "C",
  "analysis": "本题考查介词短语。A项‘代替’；B项‘尽管’；C项‘除了’；D项‘因为’。句意：除了英语，他还会说法语。故选C。"
